ense PK battles up close on the big virtual screen for a comprehensively upgraded interactive experience.", "short_description": "Douyin VR Live is a next-generation VR user-facing streaming platform that is committed to bringing you an exhilarating and immersive interactive experience."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "logozh.png", "id": "1439261319980082", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75441583_1439261323313415_6105103478412624436_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UCHC2y203u0Q7kNvwEuP5cQ&_nc_oc=AdkSt79GQERiA1NoLMhke_c8hq5icZrO4z6qVASKt3Q_dKky4Qmb7LfSrGQaPuO9tv4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvssZ8fPXhLuVgrBn6nrWvDE8CFeRlJCQ4BxLpaR-EUEg&oe=69A6BADC"}, {"file_name": "2560 x 1440.png", "id": "1222877525073722", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982446_1222877528407055_8056433039736167714_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4fvkwZdvIoQQ7kNvwFaXFsu&_nc_oc=AdlhwqV5ILNcR60eu2H5Vyo9q1o7yXaaeYajcQ1k4vpSAGNj8Tnnc7ZwgkOl6HjBI1I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvVunzJR1KXMe9VCnaoAio1EX5a41WH49G9GhIHBcR0KQ&oe=69A6EE1C"}, {"file_name": "1440 x 1440.png", "id": "961925418233844", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036617_961925421567177_3841510894552774559_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RPaO2Dzov7wQ7kNvwGUeako&_nc_oc=AdkZbJBujbDbgWp4mnwjTUwVMwVfEAFILGpCw0m8XsBWPkGlxFjO29gX5VCzmCBw7aA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afty4GS8KDf3Zj-zsdm-RrMU3MQ_a9loI4E4qkGSIf_ASQ&oe=69A6C5C5"}, {"file_name": "1080X360.png", "id": "715848710371996", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974523_715848713705329_284747130245148719_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=reo-MeVvlckQ7kNvwFXFZ8L&_nc_oc=Adl0RYSfTFvx